Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 20:18:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(dshow): move registration to producer-owned pipe

Require a kernel-bound named-pipe client and live process before publishing a return consumer. Keep the queue mapping read-only for consumers, rearm after stale clients, and return explicitly on every rejected path.

